{"id":"aa3ceab2a7aa2799","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-limit-structure.md","title":"Limit Structure","display":"df-limit-structure — Limit Structure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-limit-structure","aliases":["17-df-limit-structure"],"display":"df-limit-structure — Limit Structure","depends_on":["[[17-df-structure]]","[[17-df-elementary-substructure]]","[[17-df-elementary-chain]]","[[17-df-chain-union]]","[[17-df-ordinals-finiteness]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_verification":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed","legacy_label":"17-df-4.7.1b","local_revision":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-limit-structure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-limit-structure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-limit-structure — Limit Structure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"71ede582cb78a069\" href=\"?note=71ede582cb78a069\" title=\"17-df-elementary-substructure\">17-df-elementary-substructure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9a564fd35615a768\" href=\"?note=9a564fd35615a768\" title=\"17-df-elementary-chain\">17-df-elementary-chain</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cbea1b33aeed1412\" href=\"?note=cbea1b33aeed1412\" title=\"17-df-chain-union\">17-df-chain-union</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b6e4a36b436c9b93\" href=\"?note=b6e4a36b436c9b93\" title=\"17-df-ordinals-finiteness\">17-df-ordinals-finiteness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-4.7.1b"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span> 是候选并结构；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Limit}(\\kappa)\">\\(\\operatorname{Limit}(\\kappa)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b6e4a36b436c9b93\" href=\"?note=b6e4a36b436c9b93\" title=\"17-df-ordinals-finiteness\">17-df-ordinals-finiteness</a>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> is a nonzero limit ordinal and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i&lt;\\kappa}\">\\((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i&lt;\\kappa}\\)</span> is a family of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-structures.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ElemChain}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{ElemChain}_L\\)</span> is from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9a564fd35615a768\" href=\"?note=9a564fd35615a768\" title=\"17-df-elementary-chain\">17-df-elementary-chain</a>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L\\)</span> is from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"cbea1b33aeed1412\" href=\"?note=cbea1b33aeed1412\" title=\"17-df-chain-union\">17-df-chain-union</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LimitStructure}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{LimitStructure}_L\\)</span> is defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{LimitStructure}_L((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i&lt;\\kappa},\\mathfrak A)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{ElemChain}_L(\\kappa,&lt;,(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i&lt;\\kappa})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L(\\kappa,&lt;,(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i&lt;\\kappa},\\mathfrak A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{LimitStructure}_L((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i&lt;\\kappa},\\mathfrak A)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{ElemChain}_L(\\kappa,&lt;,(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i&lt;\\kappa})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L(\\kappa,&lt;,(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i&lt;\\kappa},\\mathfrak A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>This atom packages the explicitly constructed union of a nonempty elementary chain. The Elementary Chain Theorem then implies elementary inclusion of each stage in the union.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"71ede582cb78a069","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-elementary-substructure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-chain","status":"resolved","id":"9a564fd35615a768","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-elementary-chain]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-chain-union","status":"resolved","id":"cbea1b33aeed1412","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-chain-union]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ordinals-finiteness","status":"resolved","id":"b6e4a36b436c9b93","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-ordinals-finiteness]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ordinals-finiteness","status":"resolved","id":"b6e4a36b436c9b93","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$，$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ 是候选并结构；$\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$ 及 $\\operatorname{Limit}(\\kappa)$ 见 [[17-df-ordinals-finiteness]]。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-chain","status":"resolved","id":"9a564fd35615a768","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ElemChain}_L$ is from [[17-df-elementary-chain]], and $\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L$ is from [[17-df-chain-union]].","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-chain-union","status":"resolved","id":"cbea1b33aeed1412","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ElemChain}_L$ is from [[17-df-elementary-chain]], and $\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L$ is from [[17-df-chain-union]].","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Limit}(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i<\\kappa}","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ElemChain}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L","display":f